    title: "JS_KNOWN_GLOBALS is hand-maintained and cannot be derived because the catalogue does not record how a module is REACHED (global vs import vs constructor) — a third runtime global rowed tomorrow fails silently the way process and performance did"  # dcab
    status: todo_hard  # dcab
    priority: 2  # dcab
